00:29:39.780 --> 00:29:43.720
Sautrāntika, the second school,

00:29:43.720 --> 00:29:46.662
and another one, what's it called?

00:29:46.662 --> 00:29:48.800
KHA CHE, KHA CHE

00:29:48.800 --> 00:29:52.830
means Kashmiri, people from Kashmir.

00:29:54.000 --> 00:29:55.570
This refers to the Abhidharma school, a group that

00:29:55.570 --> 00:29:57.880
