00:29:57.880 --> 00:30:01.400
Later, that region became Muslim.

00:30:01.400 --> 00:30:05.513
Now, in western Chinese languages,
Muslim is Kashmiri

00:30:06.369 --> 00:30:08.027
KHA CHEs, the same word

00:30:08.027 --> 00:30:09.860
like @, right?

00:30:09.860 --> 00:30:12.584
Okay, let's continue

00:30:12.584 --> 00:30:14.734
, MYU GU LA SOGS RGYUN GANG NI,

00:30:14.734 --> 00:30:16.441
,SA BON LAS NI MNGON PAR 'BYUNG,

00:30:16.441 --> 00:30:18.216
,DE LAS 'BRAS BU SA BON NI,

00:30:18.216 --> 00:30:20.883
,MED NA DE YANG 'BYUNG MI 'GYUR,

00:30:22.330 --> 00:30:23.460
First, you have the seed.

00:30:23.460 --> 00:30:26.390
By the way, who is this?  Lower-level Buddhists

00:30:26.390 --> 00:30:29.690
are answering Nagarjuna's question,

00:30:29.690 --> 00:30:31.885
"First you have a seed."

00:30:33.000 --> 00:30:35.310
MYU GU LA SOGS RGYUN GANG YIN.

00:30:35.310 --> 00:30:38.463
Then the seed opens and there is flow.

00:30:39.910 --> 00:30:42.350
Sorry, before it opens,

00:30:42.350 --> 00:30:44.190
first you have a seed.

00:30:44.190 --> 00:30:47.225
Then something comes out, which is a kind of flow.

00:30:48.596 --> 00:30:52.376
This is the seed, the flow breaks through, and

00:30:53.476 --> 00:30:57.173
then it matures. Is that okay? It's

00:30:58.200 --> 00:31:01.110
not that the seed is repeating itself.

00:31:01.110 --> 00:31:03.500
That would be unchanging, and unchanging is impossible. It's that the

00:31:03.500 --> 00:31:05.200
seed immediately produces something

00:31:05.200 --> 00:31:08.520
called the flow of karma.

00:31:08.520 --> 00:31:11.873
This is the seed, karma opens and comes out. Wait, *

00:31:13.000 --> 00:31:15.427
po* [sounds]

00:31:18.220 --> 00:31:20.800
Okay, that's the maturation of karma.

00:31:20.800 --> 00:31:22.670
So it's okay. Does the

00:31:22.670 --> 00:31:24.750
seed immediately mature into karma?

00:31:24.750 --> 00:31:27.070
No, it flows.

00:31:27.070 --> 00:31:28.140
Then what happens?

00:31:28.140 --> 00:31:30.970
When the flow ends, it opens the results.

00:31:30.970 --> 00:31:31.860
Got it?

00:31:31.860 --> 00:31:33.910
Therefore, no problem.

00:31:33.910 --> 00:31:36.880
It is still changing because it is in flux,

00:31:36.880 --> 00:31:39.960
but the karma has not yet been unleashed. Do you

00:31:39.960 --> 00:31:41.626
understand?  No problem.

00:31:41.626 --> 00:31:44.250
Seed, flow, result.

00:31:44.250 --> 00:31:47.200
Seed, flow, result.

00:31:47.200 --> 00:31:48.540
Understand?

00:31:48.540 --> 00:31:51.464
That's the lower-level Buddhist school of thought.

00:31:51.464 --> 00:31:56.050
DE LAS 'BRAS BU SA BON NI

00:31:56.050 --> 00:31:58.287
Then the result

00:31:58.287 --> 00:32:01.010
MED NA DE YANG 'BYUNG MI 'GYUR The

00:32:01.010 --> 00:32:05.153
result cannot occur without a seed.

00:32:06.120 --> 00:32:08.870
Therefore, the result is connected to the seed.

00:32:08.870 --> 00:32:10.400
If the seed never occurs, the

00:32:10.400 --> 00:32:12.170


00:32:12.170 --> 00:32:13.570
result will never come out at the end of the flow.

00:32:13.570 --> 00:32:16.490
Therefore, the seed causes the result,

00:32:16.490 --> 00:32:19.530
but through a flow.

00:32:19.530 --> 00:32:21.810
So they ruled out the

00:32:21.810 --> 00:32:23.797
problem that the seed did not cause the result. The

00:32:23.797 --> 00:32:28.150
seed appears before the result, and it does cause the result.

00:32:28.150 --> 00:32:31.560
It just takes a while; it is flowing.

00:32:31.560 --> 00:32:33.443
That's the seed's business.

00:32:33.443 --> 00:32:35.650
GANG PHYIR SA BON LAS RGYUN DANG

00:32:35.650 --> 00:32:37.620
Again, how does this work?

00:32:37.620 --> 00:32:40.060
There is a SA BON, a seed,

00:32:40.060 --> 00:32:42.400
and then a flow, RGYUN,

00:32:42.400 --> 00:32:44.850
then RGYUN LAS 'BRAS BU,

00:32:44.850 --> 00:32:47.840
and then the flow becomes the result.

00:32:47.840 --> 00:32:52.840
And because the seed must precede the result,

00:32:53.660 --> 00:32:57.210
we avoid your two extremes.

00:32:57.210 --> 00:32:59.780
We avoid your two extremes.

00:32:59.780 --> 00:33:03.400
This is another version of the extreme of two husbands.

00:33:03.400 --> 00:33:06.880
This is a simpler version than the extreme of two husbands.

00:33:06.880 --> 00:33:11.220
That is, will the seed stop

00:33:11.220 --> 00:33:15.090
or will the seed remain unchanged?

00:33:15.090 --> 00:33:16.720
Both of these are extremes.

00:33:16.720 --> 00:33:17.790
Why?

00:33:17.790 --> 00:33:21.530
If the seed stops before the result comes out, there will

00:33:21.530 --> 00:33:23.270
never be a result.

00:33:23.270 --> 00:33:25.550
If the seed continues in the same way before the result comes out,

00:33:25.550 --> 00:33:29.340
it will remain unchanged.

00:33:29.340 --> 00:33:31.800
For a functional body, this is impossible.

00:33:31.800 --> 00:33:36.800
So, it's just flow, along with this flow.

00:33:37.006 --> 00:33:40.206
[Laughter] Okay?

00:33:40.206 --> 00:33:42.523
Which school of thought is at a lower level?

00:33:45.930 --> 00:33:48.192
By the way, Nagarjuna was like...

00:33:48.192 --> 00:33:50.120
everyone looking at these lower-level Buddhists

00:33:50.120 --> 00:33:55.120
like that,

00:33:55.332 --> 00:33:56.165
huh?

00:33:56.165 --> 00:34:00.270
They say, “Oh, let us explain,
let us explain further.”

00:34:00.270 --> 00:34:03.760
This usually means digging their own grave, digging even deeper.

00:34:03.760 --> 00:34:06.210
Nagarjuna’s reaction to them was, “What are you saying?”  That's

00:34:06.210 --> 00:34:09.010
how they reacted, in the next two verses.

00:34:09.010 --> 00:34:13.177
In the next two verses, they clarified their position.

00:34:14.320 --> 00:34:17.490
By the way, if you haven't studied with Lama Chögyal,
you won't understand.

00:34:17.490 --> 00:34:19.352
This sounds like Nagarjuna.

00:34:19.352 --> 00:34:24.352
Okay, @'GYUR The

00:34:24.960 --> 00:34:28.314
flow of consciousness comes from consciousness

00:34:28.314 --> 00:34:30.210
DE LAS 'BRAS BU

00:34:30.210 --> 00:34:32.343
Then it becomes a result.

00:34:36.870 --> 00:34:39.520
Consciousness produces the flow of consciousness.

00:34:39.520 --> 00:34:42.030
Then the flow of consciousness becomes a result.

00:34:42.030 --> 00:34:43.556
Three steps

00:34:45.281 --> 00:34:47.600
DE LAS 'BRAS BU.

00:34:47.600 --> 00:34:50.161
BUS, he uses the auxiliary word B-U-S

00:34:50.161 --> 00:34:52.170
BUS, which means "therefore". The

00:34:52.170 --> 00:34:55.600
other person is making a summary

00:34:55.600 --> 00:34:58.950
because there is consciousness, because at that time there was the flow of consciousness.

00:34:58.950 --> 00:35:01.572
Then the result comes, but therefore

00:35:01.572 --> 00:35:04.692
@SEMS.

00:35:04.692 --> 00:35:07.071
@SEMS means that

00:35:07.071 --> 00:35:10.540
this is a common expression, meaning

00:35:11.570 --> 00:35:14.911
stop saying "no consciousness", you must be conscious.

00:35:14.911 --> 00:35:17.480
@SEMS means that stop saying "no consciousness", you

00:35:17.480 --> 00:35:18.313
must be conscious.

00:35:18.313 --> 00:35:19.146
Why?

00:35:19.146 --> 00:35:22.430
I just told you: consciousness, flow, result. Do

00:35:22.430 --> 00:35:23.760
n't tell me you don't have consciousness.

00:35:23.760 --> 00:35:25.740
In the beginning,

00:35:25.740 --> 00:35:27.069
without it, there is nothing.

00:35:27.069 --> 00:35:27.902
@SEMS means

00:35:27.902 --> 00:35:31.151
you can't give up consciousness; you must have consciousness.

00:35:31.151 --> 00:35:33.412
@ means

00:35:33.412 --> 00:35:36.359
what does it mean to have no consciousness?

00:35:36.359 --> 00:35:39.200
@SEMS... MED NA

00:35:39.200 --> 00:35:42.290
If consciousness isn't there, the whole process of 'BYUNG MI 'GYUR'

00:35:42.290 --> 00:35:44.070
absolutely won't happen.

00:35:44.070 --> 00:35:48.720
It must start with consciousness, and then consciousness flows.

00:35:48.720 --> 00:35:51.780
If you say the flow of consciousness isn't part of the process

00:35:51.780 --> 00:35:53.282
, then how can you have karma if you don't have any thoughts

00:35:53.282 --> 00:35:56.310
?

00:35:56.310 --> 00:35:57.787
He's like...

00:35:58.900 --> 00:36:01.910
what's this called? [Blurred]?

00:36:01.910 --> 00:36:04.130
[Student's answer]

00:36:04.130 --> 00:36:05.094
Logic

00:36:05.094 --> 00:36:07.510
[Student's answer]

00:36:07.510 --> 00:36:11.020
You are changing your wording.

00:36:11.020 --> 00:36:13.600
In any case, it must start with consciousness.

00:36:13.600 --> 00:36:14.433
Why?

00:36:14.433 --> 00:36:15.870
Karma begins with consciousness. Do

00:36:15.870 --> 00:36:17.010
you mean there is no consciousness?

00:36:17.010 --> 00:36:18.240
No, no, no, conscious.

00:36:18.240 --> 00:36:19.073
Why?

00:36:19.073 --> 00:36:20.220
Consciousness is the foundation of karma.

00:36:20.220 --> 00:36:22.681
Okay, it's flowing. Do you have any questions?

00:36:22.681 --> 00:36:25.885
[Laughter] That's what he said.

00:36:25.885 --> 00:36:28.730
Anyway, without consciousness,
you can never have karmic results.

00:36:28.730 --> 00:36:32.220
So don't tell me the theory of flow is wrong

00:36:32.220 --> 00:36:34.350
because flow is the flow of consciousness.

00:36:34.350 --> 00:36:37.180
You agree that it must have existed in the beginning,

00:36:37.180 --> 00:36:38.373
understand?

00:36:38.373 --> 00:36:39.402
Okay

00:36:39.402 --> 00:36:41.160
%GANG PHYIR SA BON LAS RGYUN DANG NI

00:36:41.160 --> 00:36:42.689
RGYUN LAS 'BRAS BU 'BYUNG 'GYUR ZHING

00:36:42.689 --> 00:36:46.930
I just told you, the flow comes from consciousness,

00:36:46.930 --> 00:36:48.700
then consciousness keeps flowing,

00:36:48.700 --> 00:36:50.010
and then at the end of the flow

00:36:50.010 --> 00:36:53.224
you get a 'BRAS BU, you get a result

00:36:53.224 --> 00:36:54.723
LAS NI 'BRAS BU'I SNGON 'GRO BA

00:36:54.723 --> 00:36:56.778
DE PHYIR CHAD MIN RTAG MA YIN

00:36:56.778 --> 00:37:01.340
And because karma is planted in consciousness, it

00:37:01.340 --> 00:37:06.340
must precede the result.
I avoided your questions.

00:37:06.360 --> 00:37:08.500
I avoided the two questions you raised.

00:37:08.500 --> 00:37:10.410
What were the two questions we raised?

00:37:10.410 --> 00:37:12.950
First, will the seed of karma

00:37:15.480 --> 00:37:19.130
continuously replicate itself,

00:37:19.130 --> 00:37:23.433
or will it only... What's your name?  Do

00:37:25.100 --> 00:37:27.990


00:37:27.990 --> 00:37:28.823
you understand what truncation means?

00:37:28.823 --> 00:37:32.185
Actually, it's a perfect word. Write it down.

00:37:32.185 --> 00:37:36.470
Okay, we've finished the first half of this chapter.

00:37:36.470 --> 00:37:40.520
We'll continue our dive in the next lesson. The

00:37:40.520 --> 00:37:41.353
next lesson is Lesson 13.

00:37:41.353 --> 00:37:43.386
Let's summarize.

00:37:44.294 --> 00:37:49.000
Nagarjuna started by saying something understandable.

00:37:49.000 --> 00:37:50.980
Was he setting us up?

00:37:50.980 --> 00:37:53.520
What is karma?  He started with thinking,

00:37:53.520 --> 00:37:57.500
then moved on to actions and words driven by that thinking.

00:37:57.500 --> 00:37:59.580
He then discussed seven different categories,

00:37:59.580 --> 00:38:04.080
including the content of a halo,

00:38:04.080 --> 00:38:07.471
and emphasized,

00:38:07.471 --> 00:38:12.471
and clearly favored,

00:38:12.720 --> 00:38:15.830
support for the practical application of Buddhism,

00:38:15.830 --> 00:38:20.410
providing material support, such as projects involving scripture input.

00:38:20.410 --> 00:38:24.980
Then what did he continue to discuss?

00:38:24.980 --> 00:38:28.710
How do seeds remain in consciousness?

00:38:28.710 --> 00:38:30.760
If it doesn't change, there's a problem.

00:38:30.760 --> 00:38:33.800
If it does stop, there's a problem.

00:38:33.800 --> 00:38:38.320
Then some people try to answer that. They

00:38:38.320 --> 00:38:40.690
keep talking about

00:38:40.690 --> 00:38:44.310
flows that connect the results to the original seed,

00:38:44.310 --> 00:38:47.438
and the seed doesn't change or stop.

00:38:48.600 --> 00:38:49.850
Cool, right?

00:38:49.850 --> 00:38:52.591
Okay, see you next class.

